{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>The iniquity of the sanctuary.</b> That is, from the House to the curtain, and the meaning is: if you do not guard it, the iniquity is upon you." "And the meaning of <b>and your father's house</b> is that they bear the sanctuary." "<b>The iniquity of your priesthood.</b> If you do not guard the priesthood, the iniquity is upon you."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 18, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:12.233763456Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}